        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x align-middle">
            <div class="cell medium-7 large-8 small-12">
                <h1 class="h2">Medications for Opioid Use Disorder (MOUD) Mentorship Program</h1>

                <p>The Center for Substance Use Training & Telementoring, in collaboration with University Health,
                    offers no-cost mentoring to prescribers located in the Texas Public Health District Region 8 looking
                    to improve care for patients with opioid use disorder (OUD).</p>

                <p><a href="https://redcap.uthscsa.edu/REDCap/surveys/?s=7PHTX8PKLHHKTNTF" class="button">Sign up
                        now</a></p>
            </div>
