                <img src="../../images/c-stat/MOUD-Mentoring-Map.png">

            </div>
            <div class="cell medium-7 large-8 small-12">
                <h2 class="h3">One-on-One Mentoring</h2>
                <p>Our program supports the use of effective, evidence-based medications, helps address implementation
                    challenges, and provides complementary case consultations to strengthen clinical confidence and
                    patient outcomes.</p>

                <h3 class="h4">Who is this for?</h3>

                    <ul>
                        <li>Licensed Prescribers (e.g., MD, NP, PA, DO, etc.) who are currently prescribing medications
                            for opioid use disorder (MOUD) or are interested in beginning to do so.</li>
                        <li>Providers located in the Texas Public Health District Region 8
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                <p><a href="https://redcap.uthscsa.edu/REDCap/surveys/?s=7PHTX8PKLHHKTNTF" class="button">Sign up</a></p>

                <p>
                    This program is in partnership with University Health.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

